      "paths": [
        "src/memory-shared/",
        "src/main/ipc/shared-memory.js",
        "src/renderer/renderer-shared-memory.js"
      ],
      "owns": [
        "跨机记忆条目共享（内网 PostgreSQL dieyun_memory.shared_memory；只同步条目，不上传对话）",
        "配置与口令（shared-memory.json，密码走 src/secret-store.js 密文，默认开启）",
        "一条召回 SQL（向量距离与 trigram 相似度 COALESCE 合流；无 pgvector 时退化表达式而非第二套语义）",
        "幂等上传（content_hash 去重 + kind 门复用 project-memory-file.js#isShareableKind）",
        "提炼独占权（pg_try_advisory_lock + memory_consolidations 跨机冷却，无 master/slave）",
        "可用性判定（enabled && configured && available；连不上即关闭，不改用户开关）",
        "扩展页签「共享记忆」（设置 → 扩展）"
      ],
      "tests": [
        "test:unit",
        "check:renderer"
      ],
      "docs": [
        "docs/SHARED-MEMORY.md",
        "docs/MEMORY.md"
      ]
